# Site RPC
#
# Production default (no key in client): Cloudflare Worker proxy
#   https://sukedachi-polygon-rpc.bushidao.workers.dev
# Upstream Alchemy URL is a Worker secret (POLYGON_RPC_URL) — never VITE_*.
#
# Optional override for local debugging only (gitignored .env):
# VITE_RPC_URL=https://sukedachi-polygon-rpc.bushidao.workers.dev
#
# Do NOT put Alchemy keys in VITE_RPC_URL (bundled into public JS).
